{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2022-04-27 09:34:00', 'title': 'LUMEN TO DELIVER 30 GIGABIT ETHERNET SPEEDS TO MORE THAN 40 MARKETS NATIONWIDE', 'text': "NINE CITIES COMPLETED, NINE MORE GAIN ACCESS TO LUMEN'S HIGH-BANDWIDTH ETHERNET UPGRADE NEXT WEEK DENVER , APRIL 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LUMN) IS ENHANCING EXPERIENCES ON ITS LUMEN PLATFORM BY INVESTING IN HIGH-BANDWIDTH ETHERNET ARCHITECTURE TO BRING UPGRADED ETHERNET SERVICES TO MORE THAN 40 CITIES BY YEAR END. THESE SERVICES WERE RECENTLY ROLLED OUT IN NINE CITIES WITH NINE MORE GAINING ACCESS TO ETHERNET SPEEDS UP TO 30 GIGABITS PER SECOND IN EARLY MAY."}